            "block_content": "SECTION 7.4. Work schedules shall be posted in appropriate locations no later than noon Thursday of the preceding week. When hours of scheduled work remain the same from week to week a single posting shall be sufficient, except as provided for in Article 7, Section 7.2. Holiday schedules shall be posted at least fourteen (14) days before such holiday.",
