        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When twenty-four hours or more notice before the start of work on the original daily tour is given, the changed tour shall become the employee's regular scheduled tour and he/she shall be compensated at the basic wage rate plus applicable premiums. When less than twenty-four (24) hours notice before the start of work on the original daily tour is given the following shall apply:",
            "block_bbox": [
                183,
