        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 7.5.1. When two (2) or more tours on a posted weekly work schedule are changed, due to Company requirements, a minimum of three (3) days notice shall be given the affected employee. When circumstance does not allow for such notice, overtime compensation will be paid for those hours worked outside the original tours by the affected employee during the succeeding three (3) calendar days following notice.",
            "block_bbox": [
