        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 7.7. Each employee who is regularly scheduled and who is unable, because of sickness, injury, emergency, or conditions beyond the employee's control, to work the hours so scheduled, shall give their Supervisor or office the maximum amount of notice possible prior to the beginning of their scheduled tour. Failure to give such notice shall constitute reason for appropriate disciplinary action by the Company.",
